  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this award is to support who in providing essential health services, and support improvement of the quality of care for infants less than 6 months. Funding will continue providing essential healthcare to internally displaced people and other highly vulnerable populations. Funding will provide essential healthcare to in hard to reach and partially accessible locations. Lastly, who will support improvement of the quality of care for infants less than 6 months in its global nutrition programming.</narrative>
  </description>
